factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script and slides_spec say the 1 lakh fingerlings will be reared across 50 hectares, but the article only states this as the planned total for the district; this is fine, but the slides say 'எத்தனை மீன்கள்?' section line 'மொத்தம் 50 ஹெக்டேர் நீர்நிலைகளில்' is consistent. However, the caption's first line says '50 ஹெக்டேரில் 1 லட்சம்' while the article says 'திட்டமிடப்பட்டுள்ளது' (planned), which the headline and caption present as an existing fact rather than a plan.
  The reel_script states the 12,000 fingerlings were released and are being reared at Thokaimalai pond, while the article says 12,000 are being reared there as the first phase; the slides say 'விடப்படுகின்றன' (are being released), which is acceptable.
  The reel_script says the scheme is implemented by the fisheries department and that the 6 ponds are under the scheme, but the article attributes the 6 ponds to the rural development and local administration department and says the scheme is being implemented there, which is consistent; no clear error here.
  The slides_spec 'எங்கே, யார்?' line says 'மீன்வளம் மற்றும் மீனவர் நலத்துறை சார்பில்' and the reel_script calls the Thokaimalai pond sentence a fact that the 'கலெக்டர்' inaugurated the scheme; the article says the scheme was launched by the collector, so this matches.
